  "Anne Boleyn was accused of witchcraft partly because she had a sixth finger on her right hand. Executed in 1536.",
  "Joan of Arc was burned as a heretic and sorceress in 1431. She was 19. The charges were political. She was canonized a saint in 1920.",
  "In Würzburg, Germany, between 1626 and 1631, over 300 people were burned — including the mayor, 19 Catholic priests, and several children as young as 7.",
