          <div style="font-size:.95rem;color:#e8d8ff;font-weight:600">Inversion &amp; Hazard Mapping</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:.76rem;color:#7060a0;margin-bottom:.55rem;line-height:1.5">Walk the path before you're on it. What kills this?</div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.5rem">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:.58rem;color:#ef4444;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.22rem">Obstacles &amp; Hazards</div>
            <textarea id="de_hazards" placeholder="What could go wrong?" style="width:100%;height:80px;background:#0a0120;border:.5px solid #2a1050;border-radius:7px;color:#d8d0f0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:.8rem;padding:.5rem .6rem;resize:vertical;box-sizing:border-box;outline:none"></textarea>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:.58rem;color:#f59e0b;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.22rem">Not-To-Do Rules</div>
            <textarea id="de_nottodo" placeholder="Actions to strictly avoid..." style="width:100%;height:80px;background:#0a0120;border:.5px solid #2a1050;border-radius:7px;color:#d8d0f0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:.8rem;padding:.5rem .6rem;resize:vertical;box-sizing:border-box;outline:none"></textarea>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#06000e;border-radius:10px;border:.5px solid #2a1050;padding:.8rem .9rem;margin-bottom:.65rem">
